    },
    {
      "text": "2.8 + log (0.27)",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "None of these",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />Concentration of salt <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></math> M<br />Concentration of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> after dissociation <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.54</mn></math> M<br />pH after salt hydrolysis may be calculated as,<br /><math> <mrow>  <mtext>pH</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mfrac>   <mtext>1</mtext>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </mfrac>  <msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>[(pK</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>w</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>pK</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>a</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msup>   <mrow>    <mtext>log(LaC</mtext></mrow>   <mo>&#x2212;</mo>  </msup>  <mtext>)]</mtext></mrow></math><br /><math><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5.6</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>[</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>]</mo></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.8</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo><mn>54</mn></math>"
